  message: "Re-confirmed + refined on fresh substrate (dogfood_tranche_07 F123.A2): isolates a specific instance of the 18-vs-8 edge-type vocab drift — depends_on (6 edges, json package.json -> npm :dependency nodes, conf 0.95) and depends_on_manifest (26, pyproject deps) bifurcate ONE dependency relation under two names, split by manifest FORMAT (json/xml/dockerfile/just/starlark/meson/hcl emit depends_on; pyproject-linker emits depends_on_manifest). depends_on has 0 grep hits in docs/hypergumbo-spec.md (undocumented), though it IS in edge_types.py:94 whose own comment (line 308) flags a sibling 'likely folds to depends_on'. Consumer asking 'what does X depend on' must union two differently-named types, one unspecified. Folds here as a concrete depends_on facet of the vocab-drift fix."  # 37af
